<header>
  <h1>IPL 2026 <span>Ball-by-Ball</span> Analytics Report</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">Granular delivery-level insights for cricket analysts &amp; team strategists</div>
  <div class="meta">
    <div class="meta-item">📅 Season: <strong>Mar 28 – Apr 21, 2026</strong></div>
