  <a href="#bowling">🎳 Bowling</a>
  <a href="#teams">📊 Teams</a>
  <a href="#extras">⚠️ Extras</a>
  <a href="#venues">🏟️ Venues</a>
</nav>

<main>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- KPI DASHBOARD                                                 -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<section id="kpis">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">★</div>
    <h2>Tournament KPI Dashboard</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card orange">
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg Runs Per Over</div>
      <div class="kpi-val">9.83</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">5,114 total runs · 520 overs</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card teal">
      <div class="kpi-label">Boundary %</div>
      <div class="kpi-val">21.5%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">706 boundary deliveries of 3,284</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card gold">
      <div class="kpi-label">Dot Ball %</div>
      <div class="kpi-val">31.4%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">1,031 dots of 3,284 deliveries</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card green">
      <div class="kpi-label">Extras Per Match</div>
      <div class="kpi-val">17.7</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">266 total extras · 15 matches</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card red">
      <div class="kpi-label">Wickets Per Match</div>
      <div class="kpi-val">11.7</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">176 total wickets · 15 matches</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="insight">
    <strong>Analyst Note:</strong> An average of <strong>9.83 RPO</strong> reflects an extremely aggressive tournament — over 5 runs above the historical T20 norm. The <strong>21.5% boundary rate</strong> (1-in-5 deliveries going to the fence) combined with only <strong>31.4% dot balls</strong> signals batters dominating. At <strong>11.7 wickets/match</strong>, the balance between bat and ball is competitive but tilts batting-heavy.
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- TOURNAMENT OVERVIEW                                           -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<section id="overview">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">1</div>
    <h2>Tournament Overview &amp; Match Summary</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="overview-stats">
    <div class="stat-box">
      <div class="num">15</div>
      <div class="lbl">Matches Played</div>
    </div>
