    </div>
    <div class="stat-box">
      <div class="num">176–177</div>
      <div class="lbl">Avg Score (Inns 1 &amp; 2)</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="two-col">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>🏟️ Teams (10 Franchises)</h3>
